R9_17_1413.txt contains two copies of one part of Google's graph unchanged, as induced subgraphs: rows 0 to 563 of
Google's file (two copies of that 564-vertex block). The edges between the two copies and the 284 new vertices are new.
Google's own edges between that block and the rest of Google's file are not included.

